<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Marquette Med,Wesley Jessen started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Marquette Med,Wesley Jessen started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Rick Wise has started coverage of Marquette Medical Systems Inc and Wesley Jessen VisionCare Inc with ratings of attractive, a source at the brokerage said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in Marquette Medical, a Milwaukee maker of medical electronics company, closed on Tuesday at 19-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Shares in Wesley Jessen, a maker of soft contact lens, closed on Tuesday at 15-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
